   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-01-29",
   "text": "Permanent Tax Cuts for Americans Act\n This bill makes permanent the provisions of subtitle A (Individual Tax Reform) and subtitle B (Alternative Minimum Tax) of P.L. 115-97 (commonly known as the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act) that are currently scheduled to terminate on December 31, 2025."
  }
